imated. Personally, he is a robotics lover and passionate about embedded programming.","/media/krzysztof-piaskowy.png",{"twitter":49,"github":50},"https://x.com/piaskowyk","https://github.com/piaskowyk","src/content/team/2026-01-07-krzysztof-piaskowy.md","95433c38c624d746",{"html":28,"metadata":54},{"headings":55,"localImagePaths":56,"remoteImagePaths":57,"frontmatter":58,"imagePaths":60},[],[],[],{"name":44,"role":45,"bio":46,"image":47,"order":19,"social":59},{"twitter":49,"github":50},[],"2026-01-07-krzysztof-piaskowy.md","2026-01-07-krzysztof-piaskowy3",{"id":62,"data":64,"filePath":68,"digest":69,"rendered":70,"legacyId":78},{"name":65,"role":45,"bio":66,"image":47,"order":25,"social":67},"Krzysztof Piaskowy3","Krzysztof is a React Native open-source developer at Software Mansion. He contributes to the React Native core and other projects that exist in the ecosystem like Hermes, react-native-wgpu, and react-native-gesture-handler. His colleagues often joke that he is the Godfather of Reanimated. Personally, he is a robotics lover and passionate about embedded programming.",{"twitter":49,"github":50},"src/content/team/2026-01-07-krzysztof-piaskowy3.md","322ea48084d1b2ec",{"html":28,"metadata":71},{"headings":72,"localImagePaths":73,"remoteImagePaths":74,"frontmatter":75,"imagePaths":77},[],[],[],{"name":65,"role":45,"bio":66,"image":47,"order":25,"social":76},{"twitter":49,"github":50},[],"2026-01-07-krzysztof-piaskowy3.md","2026-01-07-krzysztof-piaskowy2",{"id":79,"data":81,"filePath":86,"digest":87,"rendered":88,"legacyId":96},{"name":82,"role":45,"company":83,"bio":84,"image":47,"order":22,"social":85},"Krzysztof Piaskowy2","Meta","Krzysztof is a React Native open-source developer at Software Mansion. He contributes to the React Native core and other projects that exist in the ecosystem like Hermes, react-native-wgpu, and react-native-gesture-handler. His colleagues often joke that he is the Godfather of Reanimated. Personally, he is a robotics lover and passionate about embedded programming.  His colleagues often joke that he is the Godfather of Reanimated. Personally, he is a robotics lover and passionate about embedded programming.  His colleagues often joke that he is the Godfather of Reanimated. Personally, he is a robotics lover and passionate about embedded programming.",{"twitter":49},"src/content/team/2026-01-07-krzysztof-piaskowy2.md","5161b80c872cefa3",{"html":28,"metadata":89},{"headings":90,"localImagePaths":91,"remoteImagePaths":92,"frontmatter":93,"imagePaths":95},[],[],[],{"name":82,"role":45,"company":83,"bio":84,"image":47,"order":22,"social":94},{"twitter":49},[],"2026-01-07-krzysztof-piaskowy2.md","2026-01-07-krzysztof-piaskowy4",{"id":97,"data":99,"filePath":102,"digest":103,"rendered":104,"legacyId":112},{"name":100,"role":45,"bio":46,"image":47,"order":36,"social":101},"Krzysztof Piaskowy4",{"twitter":49,"github":50},"src/content/team/2026-01-07-krzysztof-piaskowy4.md","57f05ddb9f39cd2f",{"html":28,"metadata":105},{"headings":106,"localImagePaths":107,"remoteImagePaths":108,"frontmatter":109,"imagePaths":111},[],[],[],{"name":100,"role":45,"bio":46,"image":47,"order":36,"social":110},{"twitter":49,"github":50},[],"2026-01-07-krzysztof-piaskowy4.md","general",["Map",113,115],{"id":113,"data":116,"filePath":119,"digest":120},{"editionNumber":117,"editionYear":118},"2","2026","src/content/general/general.yaml","4684d62ab6f8fda3","venue",["Map",121,123],{"id":121,"data":124,"filePath":142,"digest":143},{"description_paragraph1":125,"description_paragraph2":126,"description_paragraph3":127,"eventLocation":128,"polaroidCardImages":129,"carouselImages":131},"Workshops take place at Olive Tree Mansion, a luxury villa just 400 meters from Jadro Beach on the beautiful island of Vir. Surrounded by olive trees, it offers an outdoor pool and a rooftop terrace with a sea view for relaxing after workshops.","Each apartment has a private bathroom, air conditioning, and access to a shared kitchen, dining area, and Wi-Fi. Located in a quiet part of Vir, the villa has everything you need for a pleasant stay – with Zadar Airport just 40 km away and easily accessible via the bridge.","Along with comfortable accommodations, the workshop includes delicious and fresh breakfasts, lunches, dinners, and soft drinks.","Olive Tree Mansion, Vir Island, Croatia",[130],"/media/venue-section-img-main.png",[132,133,134,135,136,137,138,139,140,141],"/media/venue-section-carousel-1.png","/media/venue-section-carousel-2.png","/media/venue-section-carousel-3.png","/media/venue-section-carousel-4.png","/media/venue-section-carousel-5.png","/media/venue-section-carousel-6.png","/media/venue-section-carousel-7.png","/media/venue-section-carousel-8.png","/media/venue-section-carousel-9.png","/media/venue-section-carousel-10.png","src/content/venue/venue.yaml","97244cd100f5c85c","contact",["Map",144,146],{"id":144,"data":147,"filePath":149,"digest":150},{"discordUrl":148},"https://discord.gg/P36FTt2U","src/content/contact/contact.yaml","6ba77bc958e6e990","faq",["Map",153,154,168,169,183,184,198,199,213,214],"2026-01-07-can-i-attend-the-workshops-remotely",{"id":153,"data":155,"filePath":158,"digest":159,"rendered":160,"legacyId":167},{"question":156,"answer":157,"order":36},"Can I attend the workshops remotely?","TBD","src/content/faq/2026-01-07-can-i-attend-the-workshops-remotely.md","d6d222e6191ab574",{"html":28,"metadata":161},{"headings":162,"localImagePaths":163,"remoteImagePaths":164,"frontmatter":165,"imagePaths":166},[],[],[],{"question":156,"answer":157,"order":36},[],"2026-01-07-can-i-attend-the-workshops-remotely.md","how-big-is-workshop-group",{"id":168,"data":170,"filePath":173,"digest":174,"rendered":175,"legacyId":182},{"question":171,"answer":172,"order":19},"How big is the workshop group?","We want to make sure everyone gets the best possible learning experience, so we plan to keep each group to around 10 participants.","src/content/faq/how-big-is-workshop-group.md","63fef0e2e9526377",{"html":28,"metadata":176},{"headings":177,"localImagePaths":178,"remoteImagePaths":179,"frontmatter":180,"imagePaths":181},[],[],[],{"question":171,"answer":172,"order":19},[],"how-big-is-workshop-group.md","workshop-languages",{"id":183,"data":185,"filePath":188,"digest":189,"rendered":190,"legacyId":197},{"question":186,"answer":187,"order":25},"What languages will the workshops be held in?","The workshops will be in English.","src/content/faq/workshop-languages.md","533925464c70c469",{"html":28,"metadata":191},{"headings":192,"localImagePaths":193,"remoteImagePaths":194,"frontmatter":195,"imagePaths":196},[],[],[],{"question":186,"answer":187,"order":25},[],"workshop-languages.md","skill-level-required",{"id":198,"data":200,"filePath":203,"digest":204,"rendered":205,"legacyId":212},{"question":201,"answer":202,"order":22},"What is the skill level required to attend the workshop?","You should know how to build your app with Android Studio and Xcode and have basic knowledge of Software Mansion's libraries stack & Expo development workflow. If you have any doubts, please contact us directly!","src/content/faq/skill-level-required.md","1ed9717e5586f4a4",{"html":28,"metadata":206},{"headings":207,"localImagePaths":208,"remoteImagePaths":209,"frontmatter":210,"imagePaths":211},[],[],[],{"question":201,"answer":202,"order":22},[],"skill-level-required.md","personalized-workshop-for-team",{"id":213,"data":215,"filePath":219,"digest":220,"rendered":221,"legacyId":228},{"question":216,"answer":217,"order":218},"Can you organize a personalized workshop for my team?","Absolutely! Just reach out via the contact form at the bottom of the page (or email us at events@swmansion.com). We’d be happy to discuss arranging a workshop in the villa just for your team.",5,"src/content/faq/personalized-workshop-for-team.md","a5c05ec026e00ffe",{"html":28,"metadata":222},{"headings":223,"localImagePaths":224,"remoteImagePaths":225,"frontmatter":226,"imagePaths":227},[],[],[],{"question":